{"中文":{"登录":[{"url":"bwiki:1/15/81jq1g8yrn9vwbhl8s5svjr02b6ar9b.mp3","text":"在这么乱的地方你居然还能找到东西，唉，也算是种本事了。","alt":"voice_cn/char_4062_totter/cn_001.mp3"}],"交谈":[{"url":"bwiki:d/d5/kt1cxwjiz5jrna8w4xo3xtuyxex0hw7.mp3","text":"博士，我可以申请免去文书工作吗？我远视有些严重，看字很费劲，也很容易疲劳。","alt":"voice_cn/char_4062_totter/cn_002.mp3"},{"url":"bwiki:b/b0/763ihxa1hafy8iuoskwtz7wacqnl0bm.mp3","text":"我性格闷，不爱讲话，如果觉得无聊，你就先回去吧。不是，我没有赶你的意思，只是......","alt":"voice_cn/char_4062_totter/cn_003.mp3"},{"url":"bwiki:c/cb/jh13x1v4roof4867swpt7ukg8fnojiv.mp3","text":"不必再为我配备瞄准镜了。在弩箭的杀伤距离内，我肉眼就已经足够看清楚。","alt":"voice_cn/char_4062_totter/cn_004.mp3"}],"晋升交谈":[{"url":"bwiki:b/b8/3rtrbfom9n84k0ywrfny6p5l1zf7byw.mp3","text":"我的箭头是特制的，破甲的同时还能在短时间内让敌人大量失血，箭头原型是萨尔贡的猎人们专用来狩猎大型猛兽的，来到维多利亚后我进行了改造，更轻盈，杀伤力也更强。","alt":"voice_cn/char_4062_totter/cn_005.mp3"},{"url":"bwiki:d/d2/hkr0ab3ia3pt2gvfh989rbakcgassfe.mp3","text":"佣兵这行当然辛苦，有时在雪地中一守就是一天，任务结束脚都冻麻了。你倒也不用露出这样的表情，还好，冻麻了左脚就没有那么痛了。","alt":"voice_cn/char_4062_totter/cn_006.mp3"}],"信赖":[{"url":"bwiki:4/4d/7kqperex30k5g2c6rmzsxkajkr72lr4.mp3","text":"你问我喜欢雪的原因？让我想想......以前在萨尔贡没见过算吗？呵，其实也不必深究，人总有些爱好会来得莫名其妙。","alt":"voice_cn/char_4062_totter/cn_007.mp3"},{"url":"bwiki:d/dc/hmomcdp20qxc9hqy3pl2o7s99zez417.mp3","text":"......有个不情之请，可以拜托博士你帮我念下这书上的诗吗？真理小姐借给我的，据说是首很美的诗，写的是圣骏堡的冬天。","alt":"voice_cn/char_4062_totter/cn_008.mp3"},{"url":"bwiki:6/63/eq2qmqqsl4dgxyahnp6od2zi7v2xfdr.mp3","text":"你知道什么是最珍贵的吗？一个可以一起安静看雪的人。或许曾经我也遇到过吧，但是谁知道呢？大雪刮起来，所有踪迹都会被覆盖，包括远去的脚印。","alt":"voice_cn/char_4062_totter/cn_009.mp3"}],"闲置":[{"url":"bwiki:4/4b/3r1f9geoi3b5k01qxlnr98dbkqeqw1b.mp3","text":"我倒杯热水给你？你看着脸色不太好。","alt":"voice_cn/char_4062_totter/cn_010.mp3"}],"报到":[{"url":"bwiki:c/c8/3pr7lqwrzeolk2u6u0s5u9y7d2qj10h.mp3","text":"博士你好，我是铅踝，擅长远距离狙击，工作日内若有大小任务都可以交付给我。","alt":"voice_cn/char_4062_totter/cn_011.mp3"}],"作战记录":[{"url":"bwiki:7/7a/pwjkrd3dwwxvlpghfm7s05bf7yqe4e3.mp3","text":"稍等，博士，距离太近了，我戴个眼镜再看。","alt":"voice_cn/char_4062_totter/cn_012.mp3"}],"精英化1":[{"url":"bwiki:3/3b/emgv8pygiv5o3wwll915uwg7rhwduqd.mp3","text":"你对我的工作成果感到满意，那是再好不过了。","alt":"voice_cn/char_4062_totter/cn_013.mp3"}],"精英化2":[{"url":"bwiki:d/d3/mwu9lvl0cn9qmrthyk9yola95b8imdg.mp3","text":"谢谢你，博士，但你的赏识反而让我觉得不知所措。唉，实话说，工作上我不是个有大志向的人。","alt":"voice_cn/char_4062_totter/cn_014.mp3"}],"编入":[{"url":"bwiki:a/a8/h5seu8jcy5rcnfrrhhs58mwfhxtkxta.mp3","text":"请尽快下达指令。","alt":"voice_cn/char_4062_totter/cn_017.mp3"}],"任命队长":[{"url":"bwiki:b/b0/h1ehse6wvebc13r6x0wyeqdtmck8amf.mp3","text":"劳烦各位配合，辛苦了。","alt":"voice_cn/char_4062_totter/cn_018.mp3"}],"行动出发":[{"url":"bwiki:3/38/c3jg3c9tztg8op45dmukaefbxdabiyj.mp3","text":"出发吧，时不待人。","alt":"voice_cn/char_4062_totter/cn_019.mp3"}],"行动开始":[{"url":"bwiki:b/ba/hmn7bv787hctu231i1mtw921w2gw6aq.mp3","text":"虽然移动得很迅速，但我还是能捕捉踪迹。","alt":"voice_cn/char_4062_totter/cn_020.mp3"}],"选中":[{"url":"bwiki:b/ba/i1u027k1p2pwhyj6iodxg4m2pc68fes.mp3","text":"坏运气，今天有雾。","alt":"voice_cn/char_4062_totter/cn_021.mp3"},{"url":"bwiki:f/fc/c86ubu407yatl8l3hkckmgso08bip0i.mp3","text":"顺风，今天运气很好。","alt":"voice_cn/char_4062_totter/cn_022.mp3"}],"部署":[{"url":"bwiki:f/f3/sez3lywnwmz6fte7i3p5x7fex99dy5a.mp3","text":"有白汽冒出，雪地中可能有敌人。","alt":"voice_cn/char_4062_totter/cn_023.mp3"},{"url":"bwiki:d/da/izlv7ygw3q0wxpj5pelk9w02r9v3svs.mp3","text":"有羽兽飞出，草丛中可能有埋伏。","alt":"voice_cn/char_4062_totter/cn_024.mp3"}],"技能":[{"url":"bwiki:7/74/1d9c8dk23iz65ufeyta65tytfo2wwc6.mp3","text":"别躲了。","alt":"voice_cn/char_4062_totter/cn_025.mp3"},{"url":"bwiki:9/97/oi64myhm0p1fztvitzlgmlx9dtacjds.mp3","text":"我都看到了。","alt":"voice_cn/char_4062_totter/cn_026.mp3"},{"url":"bwiki:a/ab/q3hyvppfi6qo78a90qehnjfzaj1ivcd.mp3","text":"别动了。","alt":"voice_cn/char_4062_totter/cn_027.mp3"},{"url":"bwiki:e/e7/g1a1r58lrqdrygpox5uhxqcc8n5oamc.mp3","text":"不会有用的。","alt":"voice_cn/char_4062_totter/cn_028.mp3"}],"高难胜利":[{"url":"bwiki:d/d7/75mf74tlrbwk971okmbxyrmlyqhoi8x.mp3","text":"一击毙命最好，对方不会很痛苦。","alt":"voice_cn/char_4062_totter/cn_029.mp3"}],"3星胜利":[{"url":"bwiki:c/cd/8t8zv2cof3b9sitzwymrcusr2vkprwx.mp3","text":"目标已清除，任务顺利完成。","alt":"voice_cn/char_4062_totter/cn_030.mp3"}],"非3星胜利":[{"url":"bwiki:6/61/hvtyyfh5ego7830q1oaq3b814r6vzq2.mp3","text":"啧，偏了点。","alt":"voice_cn/char_4062_totter/cn_031.mp3"}],"失败":[{"url":"bwiki:c/cb/jbo4z4m4ajkv990ana8zcc3ltpko4nu.mp3","text":"抱歉，博士，目标已在狙击范围之外，我无法击杀。","alt":"voice_cn/char_4062_totter/cn_032.mp3"}],"进驻":[{"url":"bwiki:4/4a/3gatspa4lbv150f139kfubchgk1zk5n.mp3","text":"挺好的，比起我的安全屋，这里称得上豪华。","alt":"voice_cn/char_4062_totter/cn_033.mp3"}],"戳一下":[{"url":"bwiki:8/80/ia3o34110cycrlu9gs3y8gef6lh5sry.mp3","text":"你说，我在听。","alt":"voice_cn/char_4062_totter/cn_034.mp3"}],"信赖触摸":[{"url":"bwiki:f/f9/1b6s2otolc8ynswxs47it96ksixbkd5.mp3","text":"博士，是你吗？虽然看不清，但你的脚步声很独特，我能识别。","alt":"voice_cn/char_4062_totter/cn_036.mp3"}],"标题":[{"url":"bwiki:2/23/rtggba2fq154p7ncxzvnkumrdm6c0e1.mp3","text":"明日方舟。","alt":"voice_cn/char_4062_totter/cn_037.mp3"}],"新年":[{"url":"bwiki:f/f9/20cy4kbqxv2d7pef4vtmprv9vhgu18r.mp3","text":"今天来时发现外面下了很大的雪，甲板上白茫茫一片，很漂亮，你也可以去看看。哦，对了，新年快乐。","alt":"voice_cn/char_4062_totter/cn_038.mp3"}],"问候":[{"url":"bwiki:9/94/05rnb8grms9jhwghw68awjv4hu0x5hc.mp3","text":"你好。","alt":"voice_cn/char_4062_totter/cn_042.mp3"}]},"日文":{"登录":[{"url":"bwiki:c/cd/5c7agx0152vsazls9x6fl91pacn7y9u.mp3","text":"在这么乱的地方你居然还能找到东西，唉，也算是种本事了。","alt":"voice/char_4062_totter/cn_001.mp3"}],"交谈":[{"url":"bwiki:e/e2/bm2c3hgfoyer9efnyxp73qx4mo32bex.mp3","text":"博士，我可以申请免去文书工作吗？我远视有些严重，看字很费劲，也很容易疲劳。","alt":"voice/char_4062_totter/cn_002.mp3"},{"url":"bwiki:0/0b/f4g97gmricky775vnjn2fsww14ttc2m.mp3","text":"我性格闷，不爱讲话，如果觉得无聊，你就先回去吧。不是，我没有赶你的意思，只是......","alt":"voice/char_4062_totter/cn_003.mp3"},{"url":"bwiki:d/da/309gg88oqob3qz80qa7fncy0o2sge2x.mp3","text":"不必再为我配备瞄准镜了。在弩箭的杀伤距离内，我肉眼就已经足够看清楚。","alt":"voice/char_4062_totter/cn_004.mp3"}],"晋升交谈":[{"url":"bwiki:e/e6/4l0h5o2n84oldcf6b8xmvl5kxrlye2f.mp3","text":"我的箭头是特制的，破甲的同时还能在短时间内让敌人大量失血，箭头原型是萨尔贡的猎人们专用来狩猎大型猛兽的，来到维多利亚后我进行了改造，更轻盈，杀伤力也更强。","alt":"voice/char_4062_totter/cn_005.mp3"},{"url":"bwiki:9/93/czojpbq588wxl16u2mdl9kiyju78kdd.mp3","text":"佣兵这行当然辛苦，有时在雪地中一守就是一天，任务结束脚都冻麻了。你倒也不用露出这样的表情，还好，冻麻了左脚就没有那么痛了。","alt":"voice/char_4062_totter/cn_006.mp3"}],"信赖":[{"url":"bwiki:7/72/o99y80hrn3p2vutsd0trr776advr7oz.mp3","text":"你问我喜欢雪的原因？让我想想......以前在萨尔贡没见过算吗？呵，其实也不必深究，人总有些爱好会来得莫名其妙。","alt":"voice/char_4062_totter/cn_007.mp3"},{"url":"bwiki:f/f2/tgnqogqpvpvb7cxu89vr52dzg234qi2.mp3","text":"......有个不情之请，可以拜托博士你帮我念下这书上的诗吗？真理小姐借给我的，据说是首很美的诗，写的是圣骏堡的冬天。","alt":"voice/char_4062_totter/cn_008.mp3"},{"url":"bwiki:4/45/2h3ajaytglgpb0pav4yyomkuunujj3t.mp3","text":"你知道什么是最珍贵的吗？一个可以一起安静看雪的人。或许曾经我也遇到过吧，但是谁知道呢？大雪刮起来，所有踪迹都会被覆盖，包括远去的脚印。","alt":"voice/char_4062_totter/cn_009.mp3"}],"闲置":[{"url":"bwiki:e/eb/jmamzex6vbm3rjhnsa6vroyfgol37c3.mp3","text":"我倒杯热水给你？你看着脸色不太好。","alt":"voice/char_4062_totter/cn_010.mp3"}],"报到":[{"url":"bwiki:a/ab/qtfkild8wedp606sv4rhhklzws8oh6b.mp3","text":"博士你好，我是铅踝，擅长远距离狙击，工作日内若有大小任务都可以交付给我。","alt":"voice/char_4062_totter/cn_011.mp3"}],"作战记录":[{"url":"bwiki:d/dd/2zc2qqf3id456rm1zpmspwyir3aqvx3.mp3","text":"稍等，博士，距离太近了，我戴个眼镜再看。","alt":"voice/char_4062_totter/cn_012.mp3"}],"精英化1":[{"url":"bwiki:0/00/hafp8o68e8kcy286l3hwfqax49kjdnl.mp3","text":"你对我的工作成果感到满意，那是再好不过了。","alt":"voice/char_4062_totter/cn_013.mp3"}],"精英化2":[{"url":"bwiki:8/8d/l6xnkk8hgf2rw9rnf5ho1re08twph4l.mp3","text":"谢谢你，博士，但你的赏识反而让我觉得不知所措。唉，实话说，工作上我不是个有大志向的人。","alt":"voice/char_4062_totter/cn_014.mp3"}],"编入":[{"url":"bwiki:2/21/9u3mrgy1z5egp2esrqofvlj5xha1fx7.mp3","text":"请尽快下达指令。","alt":"voice/char_4062_totter/cn_017.mp3"}],"任命队长":[{"url":"bwiki:a/a3/esmltg6m453yrp4gf6ovf2hjr9mncsm.mp3","text":"劳烦各位配合，辛苦了。","alt":"voice/char_4062_totter/cn_018.mp3"}],"行动出发":[{"url":"bwiki:7/7f/ds3o1tg8g6kaop49fb8a8i3ffm4luqq.mp3","text":"出发吧，时不待人。","alt":"voice/char_4062_totter/cn_019.mp3"}],"行动开始":[{"url":"bwiki:4/45/ou8nczav806tw341eod8jo3mt9apni8.mp3","text":"虽然移动得很迅速，但我还是能捕捉踪迹。","alt":"voice/char_4062_totter/cn_020.mp3"}],"选中":[{"url":"bwiki:b/b8/knyol1cut86lq1zxzlkwnbzws1dvmv7.mp3","text":"坏运气，今天有雾。","alt":"voice/char_4062_totter/cn_021.mp3"},{"url":"bwiki:1/12/1aakubo5gnc